/* The OpenGL entry points glmt implements: GL_IMPL(return type, name, parameters).
 *
 * This list is the only place that says a function exists. It declares the prototype of
 * glmt_<name> and puts the name in the table glmt_get_proc_address reads. A function defined
 * without a line here fails the build (no previous prototype), and so does a line without a
 * function (undefined reference).
 *
 * An OpenGL 1.1 name that is not here gets a stub that logs the call (gl_core.inc). */

